 The teacher wants to make sure the students understand the structure of these problems, so she explains that the problem is structured as: Start with some number of items, then some are used or taken away, and then some are added. She tells them that they can solve these problems by using the formula: Start with - Used + Added = Final amount. So, using this formula, what is the answer to the problem?

